		{"id":"40779c8abfa80425","type":"text","text":"Cyn and Raine bump into each other at Ex's house on the night Raine decides to steal the coworker's belongings back, Raine blackmails Cyn to avoid getting in direct trouble with the firm","x":-940,"y":-2307,"width":500,"height":200},
		{"id":"3e73c87780536709","type":"text","text":"Jess begins to find ways to blamelessly/inconspicuously harm people around her (schoolmates, family, friends) while progressively turning to harsher forms of torment","x":-560,"y":-3360,"width":720,"height":140},
		{"id":"425adbd24713428d","type":"text","text":"Dev leaves work for the day, encountering a group of mafia members that are in the middle beating up his boyfriend, then fends them off even as it's too late to save said boyfriend","x":20,"y":-3060,"width":472,"height":220},
