		{"id":"a4653fa75c3bfef5","type":"text","text":"Dev becomes a Chromatic, hoping for another shot at staying alive without the mafia knowing where he is, alongside the chance to take down the mafia once and for all now that he's a more capable fighter","x":2660,"y":-3060,"width":500,"height":210},
