		{"id":"3d41a32004a36de8","type":"text","text":"Mafia ends up targeting Dev for killing some of the gang members that targeted his bf, and the mafia starts tracking Dev down","x":660,"y":-3060,"width":440,"height":178},
		{"id":"685876d07f8e6884","type":"text","text":"After Dev keeps getting into encounters that end up killing more mafia members, the mafia decides to blow up Dev's house (though Dev was away on some vacation while that happened) which makes Dev perpetually paranoid for his own safety ","x":1200,"y":-3060,"width":580,"height":200},
