		{"id":"7555250f8eecb3b6","type":"text","text":"Chromatic mission happens near Jay's apartment, and a chromatic missteps into Jay's room, causing him to fight back and he inadvertently kills the chromatic.","x":-400,"y":420,"width":500,"height":180},
