		{"id":"1109af9c058884a0","type":"text","text":"Cole ranks up within the syndicate by taking down a bunch of Chromatics and doing various jobs for the org, though multiple changes in leadership within the syndicate make his status and relationships within the group unstable","x":-1580,"y":-860,"width":620,"height":200},
		{"id":"c31c6d5420f1157d","type":"text","text":"Star's double starts taking fewer roles that require Star to act as a double, so Star begins to rely on his trading ties to stay afloat","x":-2040,"y":-1500,"width":528,"height":140},
		{"id":"befc526dfa5ca786","type":"text","text":"Star begins to gain ties with crime groups to make extra money off selling illicit drugs to studio staff/actors","x":-2540,"y":-1500,"width":453,"height":137},
		{"id":"5211e1fdc855f6d4","type":"text","text":"Star becomes a Chromatic","x":-520,"y":-1460,"width":327,"height":60},
		{"id":"cf6d5103aa28555b","type":"text","text":"Syl tracks down the targeted student to help them fend off of any other Chromatics following them, but the student has already turned resentful towards Chromatics as a whole, forcing Syl to kill them to avoid getting in trouble with her agency","x":-520,"y":-1780,"width":531,"height":242},
		{"id":"74a182ac753e9632","type":"text","text":"Actor gives Star ultimatum on either working in the studio or holding ties with his trading network, since the actor is implicated in Star's activities","x":-1420,"y":-1520,"width":440,"height":180},
