		{"id":"439fadb666c4520b","x":2180,"y":-3760,"width":460,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Chromatics begin to whittle away at the organization's other guards, leaving essentially just Amber and Jasper to fend off the organization's threats"},
		{"id":"9499bfbf149766b9","type":"text","text":"Amber and Jasper are assigned to track down and kill any Chromatics they see to avoid any future threats to their organization","x":2720,"y":-3760,"width":426,"height":194},
		{"id":"d7f94c11251f0291","x":-360,"y":-3760,"width":440,"height":98,"type":"text","text":"Amber and Jasper join the organization separately as bodyguards"},
		{"id":"f18ba6e634b1d964","x":1100,"y":-3780,"width":460,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Chromatics begin targeting organization, Amber and Lucas manage to fend off against the first Chromatic's first mission against the org"},
		{"id":"6a9dbaff76c2090d","type":"text","text":"Kade and Dawn form a romantic relationship","x":-420,"y":180,"width":374,"height":100},
		{"id":"cadd7f93afa56b20","type":"text","text":"[[Amber]]","x":-4740,"y":-3820,"width":250,"height":62},
		{"id":"57882ac67a8c0251","type":"text","text":"[[Jasper]]","x":-4740,"y":-3717,"width":250,"height":62},
		{"id":"1bc932da184b70f9","type":"text","text":"# Story sets are largely isolated from one another \n# Reading every story set isn't necessary to read any given scenario that happens after Starting Point\n# Event placement across sets isn't comparable (events farther to the right in set X might not happen later than a further left event in set Y, etc.)\n","x":-3840,"y":-4920,"width":1520,"height":658},
		{"id":"acdf4bab47185290","x":-2820,"y":-3660,"width":283,"height":92,"type":"text","text":"{undecided name} Organization is formed"},
		{"id":"ae813589b9140c72","type":"text","text":"[[Raven]]","x":-4740,"y":-3980,"width":250,"height":62},
		{"id":"a40e1c02d3f36d2f","type":"text","text":"Meet as school BFFs, then separate on their own paths","x":-3180,"y":-3020,"width":300,"height":120},
		{"id":"765f6641a950af1d","type":"text","text":"Raine's Partner-in-crime (Ex for now)","x":-4740,"y":-2720,"width":300,"height":82},
		{"id":"9dc3964bf417ed8b","x":-1680,"y":-3960,"width":400,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"Raven begins robbing graves and pawning off their findings to earn a substantial income"},
		{"id":"8ce7613ab214cfc1","x":3060,"y":-4040,"width":660,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Raven begins investigating many other people who have mysteriously died/disappeared in hopes of finding out more about Chromatics, robs more graves that they suspect come from people who have turned into Chromatics"},
		{"id":"7fa589b0adc35057","x":2480,"y":-4020,"width":540,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"Raven returns to the grave to find a Chromatic visiting the grave, and gets into a confrontation that ends with Raven killing the Chromatic"},
		{"id":"f6945e321c5adaa2","x":1840,"y":-4060,"width":580,"height":220,"type":"text","text":"Raven finds a grave that is supposed to contain a buried body (which belongs to a currently operating Chromatic), yet they are surprised to find out that the body is completely missing from the grave's casket, and suspects the person is still alive"},
		{"id":"71bdb21767ccd82c","x":3760,"y":-4040,"width":440,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Raven gets targeted by the Chromatics Org for killing the Chromatic he encountered, as well as interfering with Chromatic missions"}
	],
